# Demo do dashboard pingenty para README (gera demo.gif).
# Requer: cargo build --release + setcap (ver README) e tráfego de fundo.
# Uso: vhs demo.tape
Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Shell "bash"

Type "./demo-run.sh" Enter
Sleep 12s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
